{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-recommendation-systems","title":"图推荐系统：从协同过滤到图神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/graph-recommendation-systems","wordCount":1088,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"图推荐系统-从协同过滤到图神经网络\">图推荐系统：从协同过滤到图神经网络</h1><p>推荐系统的本质是建立用户与内容/商品之间的关联预测。当用户、商品、内容、标签、场景等实体之间的交互形成丰富的多类型关系网络时，图数据库和图算法能够挖掘出传统矩阵分解难以捕获的高阶连接信号，显著提升推荐的多样性和准确性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协同过滤（Collaborative Filtering）</td>\n<td>基于用户行为相似性推荐，分 User-CF（相似用户）和 Item-CF（相似商品）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PersonalRank</td>\n<td>个性化 PageRank，从用户出发的随机游走，在用户-商品二部图上计算排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图神经网络（GNN）</td>\n<td>在图结构上学习节点嵌入，LightGCN/PinSage 是推荐场景的代表模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径推荐</td>\n<td>通过多跳图遍历（用户→购买商品→同品牌/品类→推荐商品）发现长尾推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点相似度（Node Similarity）</td>\n<td>基于共同邻居（Jaccard 等）计算实体相似性，驱动商品相关推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二部图</td>\n<td>用户集合和商品集合之间只存在跨集合边的图结构，是协同过滤的典型图模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐图数据模型\">推荐图数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"多部图结构\">多部图结构</h3><p>电商推荐场景的典型图结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 用户节点&#10;CREATE (u:User {id: &#39;user_001&#39;, name: &#39;张三&#39;, age: 30, city: &#39;Shanghai&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- 商品节点&#10;CREATE (p:Product {id: &#39;prod_001&#39;, name: &#39;机械键盘&#39;, price: 399.0,&#10;                    brand: &#39;RealForce&#39;, category: &#39;Electronics&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- 品类节点&#10;CREATE (cat:Category {id: &#39;cat_001&#39;, name: &#39;机械键盘&#39;, parent: &#39;Electronics&#39;})&#10;CREATE (brand:Brand {id: &#39;brand_001&#39;, name: &#39;RealForce&#39;, origin: &#39;Japan&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- 标签节点&#10;CREATE (t1:Tag {name: &#39;办公&#39;, type: &#39;scene&#39;})&#10;CREATE (t2:Tag {name: &#39;游戏&#39;, type: &#39;scene&#39;})&#10;CREATE (t3:Tag {name: &#39;静音&#39;, type: &#39;feature&#39;})&#10;&#10;-- 交互关系（携带行为信号）&#10;CREATE (u)-[:VIEWED {timestamp: datetime(), duration: 30, source: &#39;search&#39;}]-&gt;(p)&#10;CREATE (u)-[:ADDED_TO_CART {timestamp: datetime()}]-&gt;(p)&#10;CREATE (u)-[:PURCHASED {timestamp: datetime(), amount: 399.0, orderId: &#39;ord_001&#39;}]-&gt;(p)&#10;CREATE (u)-[:RATED {score: 4.5, review: &#39;手感很好&#39;, at: datetime()}]-&gt;(p)&#10;&#10;-- 商品关系&#10;CREATE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]-&gt;(cat)&#10;CREATE (p)-[:FROM_BRAND]-&gt;(brand)&#10;CREATE (p)-[:TAGGED]-&gt;(t1)&#10;CREATE (p)-[:TAGGED]-&gt;(t3)&#10;&#10;-- 商品相似关系（预计算）&#10;CREATE (p)-[:SIMILAR_TO {score: 0.85, reason: &#39;same_brand&#39;}]-&gt;(p2:Product)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 用户节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u:User {id: 'user_001', name: '张三', age: 30, city: 'Shanghai'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 商品节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p:Product {id: 'prod_001', name: '机械键盘', price: 399.0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    brand: 'RealForce', category: 'Electronics'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 品类节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (cat:Category {id: 'cat_001', name: '机械键盘', parent: 'Electronics'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (brand:Brand {id: 'brand_001', name: 'RealForce', origin: 'Japan'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 标签节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (t1:Tag {name: '办公', type: 'scene'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (t2:Tag {name: '游戏', type: 'scene'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (t3:Tag {name: '静音', type: 'feature'})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 交互关系（携带行为信号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:VIEWED {timestamp: datetime(), duration: 30, source: 'search'}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:ADDED_TO_CART {timestamp: datetime()}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:PURCHASED {timestamp: datetime(), amount: 399.0, orderId: 'ord_001'}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (u)-[:RATED {score: 4.5, review: '手感很好', at: datetime()}]->(p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 商品关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:BELONGS_TO]->(cat)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:FROM_BRAND]->(brand)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:TAGGED]->(t1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:TAGGED]->(t3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 商品相似关系（预计算）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CREATE (p)-[:SIMILAR_TO {score: 0.85, reason: 'same_brand'}]->(p2:Product)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"交互权重设计\">交互权重设计</h3><p>不同行为代表不同强度的偏好信号：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行为类型</th>\n<th>默认权重</th>\n<th>时间衰减</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>曝光（未点击）</td>\n<td>0.0</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>负样本信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点击</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>弱偏好信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收藏</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中等偏好信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加购</td>\n<td>0.7</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强偏好信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>购买</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>最强偏好信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评价（好评）</td>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>显式满意度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于图的协同过滤\">基于图的协同过滤</h2><h3 id=\"user-cf-基于用户相似度\">User-CF：基于用户相似度</h3><p>找与目标用户「行为相似」的用户，推荐他们喜欢但目标用户未见过的商品：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- Step 1: 找出与 user_001 购买过相同商品的用户&#10;MATCH (target:User {id: &#39;user_001&#39;})-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(p:Product)&lt;-[:PURCHASED]-(similar:User)&#10;WHERE similar &lt;&gt; target&#10;WITH target, similar, count(p) AS commonPurchases&#10;WHERE commonPurchases &gt;= 3  -- 至少3个共同购买商品&#10;WITH target, similar, commonPurchases&#10;ORDER BY commonPurchases DESC&#10;LIMIT 50&#10;&#10;-- Step 2: 从相似用户中获取 target 未购买的商品&#10;MATCH (target)-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(alreadyBought:Product)&#10;WITH target, collect(alreadyBought.id) AS boughtIds, similar&#10;&#10;MATCH (similar)-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(rec:Product)&#10;WHERE NOT rec.id IN boughtIds&#10;WITH rec, count(similar) AS voteCount, sum(commonPurchases) AS weightedScore&#10;RETURN rec.id AS productId, rec.name, voteCount, weightedScore&#10;ORDER BY weightedScore DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Step 1: 找出与 user_001 购买过相同商品的用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (target:User {id: 'user_001'})-[:PURCHASED]->(p:Product)&#x3C;-[:PURCHASED]-(similar:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE similar &#x3C;> target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH target, similar, count(p) AS commonPurchases</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE commonPurchases >= 3  -- 至少3个共同购买商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH target, similar, commonPurchases</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY commonPurchases DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Step 2: 从相似用户中获取 target 未购买的商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (target)-[:PURCHASED]->(alreadyBought:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH target, collect(alreadyBought.id) AS boughtIds, similar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (similar)-[:PURCHASED]->(rec:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE NOT rec.id IN boughtIds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH rec, count(similar) AS voteCount, sum(commonPurchases) AS weightedScore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN rec.id AS productId, rec.name, voteCount, weightedScore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY weightedScore DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"item-cf-基于商品相似度-图遍历版\">Item-CF：基于商品相似度（图遍历版）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 基于共同购买行为计算商品相似度&#10;-- Jaccard 相似度：共同购买用户数 / (两商品各自购买用户数之并)&#10;MATCH (p1:Product)&lt;-[:PURCHASED]-(u:User)-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(p2:Product)&#10;WHERE id(p1) &lt; id(p2)&#10;WITH p1, p2, count(DISTINCT u) AS coCount&#10;MATCH (p1)&lt;-[:PURCHASED]-(u1:User)&#10;WITH p1, p2, coCount, count(DISTINCT u1) AS p1Count&#10;MATCH (p2)&lt;-[:PURCHASED]-(u2:User)&#10;WITH p1, p2, coCount, p1Count, count(DISTINCT u2) AS p2Count&#10;WITH p1, p2, coCount,&#10;     toFloat(coCount) / (p1Count + p2Count - coCount) AS jaccard&#10;WHERE jaccard &gt; 0.1&#10;MERGE (p1)-[s:SIMILAR_TO]-&gt;(p2)&#10;SET s.jaccard = jaccard, s.updatedAt = timestamp()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 基于共同购买行为计算商品相似度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- Jaccard 相似度：共同购买用户数 / (两商品各自购买用户数之并)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p1:Product)&#x3C;-[:PURCHASED]-(u:User)-[:PURCHASED]->(p2:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE id(p1) &#x3C; id(p2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH p1, p2, count(DISTINCT u) AS coCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p1)&#x3C;-[:PURCHASED]-(u1:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH p1, p2, coCount, count(DISTINCT u1) AS p1Count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (p2)&#x3C;-[:PURCHASED]-(u2:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH p1, p2, coCount, p1Count, count(DISTINCT u2) AS p2Count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH p1, p2, coCount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     toFloat(coCount) / (p1Count + p2Count - coCount) AS jaccard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE jaccard > 0.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MERGE (p1)-[s:SIMILAR_TO]->(p2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SET s.jaccard = jaccard, s.updatedAt = timestamp()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"路径推荐-多跳图遍历\">路径推荐：多跳图遍历</h3><p>路径推荐能发现传统协同过滤无法覆盖的长尾商品：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 2 跳路径推荐：用户 → 购买商品 → 同品牌/品类商品&#10;MATCH (u:User {id: &#39;user_001&#39;})-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(bought:Product)&#10;      -[:FROM_BRAND|BELONGS_TO*1..2]-(bridge)&#10;      -[:FROM_BRAND|BELONGS_TO*1..2]-(rec:Product)&#10;WHERE NOT (u)-[:PURCHASED|VIEWED]-&gt;(rec)&#10;  AND rec &lt;&gt; bought&#10;WITH rec, count(DISTINCT bought) AS support,&#10;     collect(DISTINCT bought.name)[0..3] AS becauseOf&#10;RETURN rec.name AS recommendation, support, becauseOf&#10;ORDER BY support DESC&#10;LIMIT 20\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 2 跳路径推荐：用户 → 购买商品 → 同品牌/品类商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (u:User {id: 'user_001'})-[:PURCHASED]->(bought:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      -[:FROM_BRAND|BELONGS_TO*1..2]-(bridge)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      -[:FROM_BRAND|BELONGS_TO*1..2]-(rec:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE NOT (u)-[:PURCHASED|VIEWED]->(rec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND rec &#x3C;> bought</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH rec, count(DISTINCT bought) AS support,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     collect(DISTINCT bought.name)[0..3] AS becauseOf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN rec.name AS recommendation, support, becauseOf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY support DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"基于图算法的推荐\">基于图算法的推荐</h2><h3 id=\"personalrank-个性化-pagerank\">PersonalRank：个性化 PageRank</h3><p>PersonalRank 是将 PageRank 应用于推荐的经典方法，能在用户-商品二部图上计算个性化排序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def personal_rank(graph_db, user_id: str, alpha: float = 0.85,&#10;                   max_iter: int = 20, top_k: int = 20) -&gt; list:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    PersonalRank 推荐算法&#10;    alpha: 随机游走继续概率（阻尼因子）&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 初始化：目标用户的 rank 为 1，其他为 0&#10;    # 使用 GDS 的 PersonalizedPageRank&#10;    result = graph_db.run(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        MATCH (u:User {id: $userId})&#10;        CALL gds.pageRank.stream(&#39;recommendation_graph&#39;, {&#10;            maxIterations: $maxIter,&#10;            dampingFactor: $alpha,&#10;            sourceNodes: [u]&#10;        })&#10;        YIELD nodeId, score&#10;        WITH gds.util.asNode(nodeId) AS node, score&#10;        WHERE &#39;Product&#39; IN labels(node)&#10;          AND NOT EXISTS {&#10;              MATCH (u:User {id: $userId})-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(node)&#10;          }&#10;        RETURN node.id AS productId, node.name AS productName, score&#10;        ORDER BY score DESC&#10;        LIMIT $topK&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;, userId=user_id, maxIter=max_iter, alpha=alpha, topK=top_k)&#10;&#10;    return list(result)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> personal_rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(graph_db, user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                   max_iter: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, top_k: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    PersonalRank 推荐算法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    alpha: 随机游走继续概率（阻尼因子）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 初始化：目标用户的 rank 为 1，其他为 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 使用 GDS 的 PersonalizedPageRank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> graph_db.run(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MATCH (u:User </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $userId}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        CALL gds.pageRank.stream('recommendation_graph', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            maxIterations: $maxIter,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            dampingFactor: $alpha,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sourceNodes: [u]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        YIELD nodeId, score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WITH gds.util.asNode(nodeId) AS node, score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        WHERE 'Product' IN labels(node)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          AND NOT EXISTS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              MATCH (u:User </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $userId}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)-[:PURCHASED]->(node)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        RETURN node.id AS productId, node.name AS productName, score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ORDER BY score DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        LIMIT $topK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_id, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxIter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">max_iter, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">alpha, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">topK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">top_k)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于-gds-节点相似度的协同推荐\">基于 GDS 节点相似度的协同推荐</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"-- 计算用户相似度并缓存&#10;CALL gds.nodeSimilarity.write(&#39;user_item_graph&#39;, {&#10;    writeRelationshipType: &#39;USER_SIMILAR&#39;,&#10;    writeProperty: &#39;similarity&#39;,&#10;    similarityCutoff: 0.3,&#10;    topK: 100  -- 每个用户只保留 top-100 相似用户&#10;})&#10;YIELD nodesCompared, relationshipsWritten&#10;RETURN nodesCompared, relationshipsWritten&#10;&#10;-- 基于预计算的相似度进行快速推荐&#10;MATCH (target:User {id: &#39;user_001&#39;})-[s:USER_SIMILAR]-&gt;(similar:User)&#10;WHERE s.similarity &gt; 0.5&#10;WITH similar, s.similarity AS sim&#10;ORDER BY sim DESC&#10;LIMIT 20&#10;MATCH (similar)-[:PURCHASED]-&gt;(rec:Product)&#10;WHERE NOT (target)-[:PURCHASED|VIEWED]-&gt;(rec)&#10;WITH rec, sum(sim) AS score&#10;RETURN rec.name, score&#10;ORDER BY score DESC&#10;LIMIT 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 计算用户相似度并缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CALL gds.nodeSimilarity.write('user_item_graph', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    writeRelationshipType: 'USER_SIMILAR',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    writeProperty: 'similarity',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    similarityCutoff: 0.3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    topK: 100  -- 每个用户只保留 top-100 相似用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>YIELD nodesCompared, relationshipsWritten</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN nodesCompared, relationshipsWritten</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 基于预计算的相似度进行快速推荐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (target:User {id: 'user_001'})-[s:USER_SIMILAR]->(similar:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE s.similarity > 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH similar, s.similarity AS sim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY sim DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (similar)-[:PURCHASED]->(rec:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE NOT (target)-[:PURCHASED|VIEWED]->(rec)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WITH rec, sum(sim) AS score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN rec.name, score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY score DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LIMIT 10</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"图神经网络-gnn-推荐集成\">图神经网络（GNN）推荐集成</h2><p>现代推荐系统越来越多地使用**图神经网络（GNN）**在图结构上学习用户和商品的嵌入表示，再用于推荐排序。典型模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LightGCN</td>\n<td>图卷积聚合邻居信息学习嵌入</td>\n<td>隐式反馈协同过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PinSage</td>\n<td>GraphSAGE 用于大规模商品推荐</td>\n<td>Pinterest 10B+ 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NGCF</td>\n<td>显式建模协同信号的图卷积</td>\n<td>用户行为建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KGCN</td>\n<td>结合知识图谱的图卷积</td>\n<td>需要语义理解的推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"gnn-与图数据库的集成模式\">GNN 与图数据库的集成模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    DB[图数据库\\nNeo4j/NebulaGraph] --&gt;|导出子图| Train[GNN 训练\\nPyTorch Geometric]&#10;    Train --&gt;|生成嵌入| Embed[嵌入向量\\n存入向量数据库]&#10;    Embed --&gt;|ANN 检索| Recall[召回层\\n向量相似度]&#10;    Recall --&gt;|候选商品| Rank[排序层\\n图特征 + 嵌入]&#10;    DB --&gt;|实时图特征| Rank&#10;    Rank --&gt; Result[推荐结果]\">graph LR\n    DB[图数据库\\nNeo4j/NebulaGraph] --&gt;|导出子图| Train[GNN 训练\\nPyTorch Geometric]\n    Train --&gt;|生成嵌入| Embed[嵌入向量\\n存入向量数据库]\n    Embed --&gt;|ANN 检索| Recall[召回层\\n向量相似度]\n    Recall --&gt;|候选商品| Rank[排序层\\n图特征 + 嵌入]\n    DB --&gt;|实时图特征| Rank\n    Rank --&gt; Result[推荐结果]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 从 Neo4j 导出训练数据到 PyTorch Geometric&#10;def export_to_pyg(driver, graph_name: str):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;导出图数据用于 GNN 训练&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    import torch&#10;    from torch_geometric.data import HeteroData&#10;&#10;    data = HeteroData()&#10;&#10;    # 导出用户节点特征&#10;    users = driver.session().run(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        MATCH (u:User)&#10;        RETURN u.id AS id, u.age AS age, u.cityCode AS city&#10;        ORDER BY u.id&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;)&#10;&#10;    # 导出交互边（用户-商品）&#10;    interactions = driver.session().run(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        MATCH (u:User)-[r:PURCHASED]-&gt;(p:Product)&#10;        RETURN u.internalId AS userId, p.internalId AS itemId,&#10;               r.weight AS weight&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;)&#10;&#10;    # 构建 HeteroData 对象&#10;    # ... (略)&#10;    return data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 Neo4j 导出训练数据到 PyTorch Geometric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> export_to_pyg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(driver, graph_name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"导出图数据用于 GNN 训练\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HeteroData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HeteroData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 导出用户节点特征</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> driver.session().run(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MATCH (u:User)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        RETURN u.id AS id, u.age AS age, u.cityCode AS city</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        ORDER BY u.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 导出交互边（用户-商品）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    interactions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> driver.session().run(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        MATCH (u:User)-[r:PURCHASED]->(p:Product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        RETURN u.internalId AS userId, p.internalId AS itemId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">               r.weight AS weight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 构建 HeteroData 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # ... (略)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实时推荐架构\">实时推荐架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Request[用户请求] --&gt; Cache{向量缓存?}&#10;    Cache --&gt;|命中| FastRecall[向量 ANN 召回]&#10;    Cache --&gt;|未命中| GraphRecall[图遍历召回\\n实时图特征]&#10;    FastRecall --&gt; Merge[候选合并去重]&#10;    GraphRecall --&gt; Merge&#10;    Merge --&gt; Feature[实时特征抽取\\n图数据库查询]&#10;    Feature --&gt; Rank[在线排序模型\\nXGBoost/LightGBM]&#10;    Rank --&gt; Filter[业务过滤\\n库存/地域/年龄]&#10;    Filter --&gt; Response[推荐结果]\">graph TD\n    Request[用户请求] --&gt; Cache{向量缓存?}\n    Cache --&gt;|命中| FastRecall[向量 ANN 召回]\n    Cache --&gt;|未命中| GraphRecall[图遍历召回\\n实时图特征]\n    FastRecall --&gt; Merge[候选合并去重]\n    GraphRecall --&gt; Merge\n    Merge --&gt; Feature[实时特征抽取\\n图数据库查询]\n    Feature --&gt; Rank[在线排序模型\\nXGBoost/LightGBM]\n    Rank --&gt; Filter[业务过滤\\n库存/地域/年龄]\n    Filter --&gt; Response[推荐结果]</pre><p>关键延迟预算分配（总目标 &lt; 100ms）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>预算</th>\n<th>实现方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>向量召回</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>FAISS/Milvus ANN 检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图遍历召回</td>\n<td>20ms</td>\n<td>图数据库索引查询（最多2跳）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征抽取</td>\n<td>20ms</td>\n<td>图数据库批量属性查询 + 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序模型</td>\n<td>30ms</td>\n<td>ONNX Runtime 推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务过滤</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>Redis 规则检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络+序列化</td>\n<td>10ms</td>\n<td>gRPC + Protocol Buffers</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>图推荐系统将用户-商品交互图的结构信息转化为推荐信号。基于图遍历的协同过滤（User-CF/Item-CF）能自然利用多跳关联；PersonalRank/GDS 节点相似度提供了图算法层面的标准实现；GNN（LightGCN/PinSage）将图结构信息端到端融入嵌入学习，代表了当前最高精度的推荐范式。实时推荐架构应将向量 ANN 召回（&lt; 10ms）与图遍历召回（&lt; 20ms）结合，前者保证低延迟高覆盖，后者保证结构感知的精准度。节点相似度等计算密集型算法应预计算结果并写回图数据库，在线服务直接查询预计算结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章其他文档\">本章其他文档</h2><ul>\n<li>知识图谱应用：为推荐系统提供语义增强和商品关联图谱</li>\n<li>欺诈与社交网络分析：推荐系统中的用户关系图挖掘</li>\n<li>第四章引言：本章三个应用场景的概览与适用条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图推荐系统：从协同过滤到图神经网络","id":"图推荐系统-从协同过滤到图神经网络"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐图数据模型","id":"推荐图数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"多部图结构","id":"多部图结构"},{"level":3,"text":"交互权重设计","id":"交互权重设计"},{"level":2,"text":"基于图的协同过滤","id":"基于图的协同过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"User-CF：基于用户相似度","id":"user-cf-基于用户相似度"},{"level":3,"text":"Item-CF：基于商品相似度（图遍历版）","id":"item-cf-基于商品相似度-图遍历版"},{"level":3,"text":"路径推荐：多跳图遍历","id":"路径推荐-多跳图遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"基于图算法的推荐","id":"基于图算法的推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"PersonalRank：个性化 PageRank","id":"personalrank-个性化-pagerank"},{"level":3,"text":"基于 GDS 节点相似度的协同推荐","id":"基于-gds-节点相似度的协同推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"图神经网络（GNN）推荐集成","id":"图神经网络-gnn-推荐集成"},{"level":3,"text":"GNN 与图数据库的集成模式","id":"gnn-与图数据库的集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实时推荐架构","id":"实时推荐架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章其他文档","id":"本章其他文档"}],"prev":{"title":"欺诈与社交网络图分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/graph-database-engineering/applications/fraud-social-network-analysis"},"next":null}